<title>USA: Champions Sports seeks acquisition targets.</title>
<headline>Champions Sports seeks acquisition targets.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Champions Sports Inc said Monday it has signed a joint-venture letter agreement to seek and select targets of mergers and acquisitions.</p>
<p>The company signed the letter with George Naddaff, the former chairman, chief executive and president of Boston Chicken Inc.  Naddaff will join Champions' board of directors.</p>
<p>Champions chairman and president James Martell said the company is seeking mergers and acquisitions to increase shareholders' value.</p>
<p>Champions owns and operates 18 Champions Sports Bar Restaurants.</p>
</text>
